# Stable spec ID: difford-bramble. Source checked 2026-10-13. Machine generated; not human reviewed or taste-tested.

::ingredients
(gin; London dry @ Hayman's) 1 1/2 fl oz
(lemon: juice, fresh) 1 fl oz
(simple syrup, 2:1 sugar to water; 65.0°Brix) 5/12 fl oz
(liqueur; blackberry @ Giffard Crème de Mûre) 5/12 fl oz

::equipment
(cocktail shaker)
(rocks glass, double old-fashioned)

::instructions
<shake, gin and lemon juice and syrup with ice in (cocktail shaker)>
<strain, into (rocks glass, double old-fashioned) filled with crushed ice>
<add, crushed ice to form a mound>
(liqueur; blackberry) <drizzle, over the mound>
<garnish, with blackberry and a lemon wheel dusted with icing sugar>
<serve, with a straw>

